      "content": "thanks. the traditionalist one feels a bit generic though. could you make him sound more like a sophisticated statesman actually explaining the logical benefits of preserving social stability? and for the progressive, maybe make them sound a bit more frantic or like they're just yelling slogans rather than having a coherent argument? i want the audience to see the contrast between someone who is thinking things through and someone who is just driven by emotion.",
